  unitName: Queen Magena (EU)
  unitId: 750145
  unitNumber: 7074
  description: Queen Magena, the forever Eagle of the Rising Moon, never quit her
    eagle form. She recently learnt from whom she owed the disappearance of her entire
    family. The mad eagle Noblesse is not hunting for Rabbits, she is sharpening
    her claws for a... Sharktopus?
